    "representation": "The 55 nonempty source transcription segments equal Liberpedia LP2-00–49 plus LP2-51–55, including F (index zero); source stream SHA-256 79b14e630946b64cdca838f328e73904f506df576d15e21fcb46271d4b4c8040.",
    "procedure": "Replay exactly the six source-selected 2,000-shuffle refinements using frozen pure source functions. Share identical surrogate walks across diagnostics of the same rule; independently recount tails and compare coordinates, rasters and selected measures with a separate implementation. Repeat the source square and block-comb controls.",
    "parameters": "Six selected diagnostics across four distinct rules: value/M6/absolute/unit symmetry; value/M8/relative/value fill, symmetry and components; value/M12/absolute/unit fill; prime-index/M6/relative/unit fill. Seeds 103301..105300, 2,000 shuffles per rule = 8,000 null walks; two plants with 200 shuffles each.",
    "exclusions": "No new 72-rule screening pass, new drawing rule, per-page reset, pen-up marker, 3D route, glyph recognition or plaintext extraction. No independently validated Gaussian-tail or familywise-probability claim. The other rules remain covered only by the earlier 200-shuffle baseline."
