  "outcome": "not-supported",
  "finding": "No selected diagnostic passes both source gates. All six empirical frequencies and false flags reproduce the pinned ledger; four Gaussian tails differ numerically beyond rounding, with maximum absolute difference 0.0000237632. Six diagnostics share four 2,000-shuffle walk series. Both source plants pass and independent arithmetic and path checks agree.",
  "limitations": "Empirical zero is a finite-sample floor. Gaussian extrapolation is unvalidated, especially for discrete raster counts; the 72-by-6 source correction does not make this an independently validated familywise probability. This selected followup does not exclude arbitrary geometry or provide plaintext. Archived Gaussian values are not fully numerically reproduced.",
  "next_steps": "Any distinct geometric proposal needs a frozen drawing/readout rule, recognizable feature and relevant calibration before target inspection.",
